              "description": "Forging, extrusion-based machining, billet machining, heat treatment, anodizing, and inspection for 6061, 7075, 2024, and related wrought alloys."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
              "@type": "Service",
              "name": "Copper and Brass Components",
